{"asset_key":"ep1/env_story_11309420","episode":"ep1","category":"env_story","story_id":"11309420","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1130942001:1":{"text":"한쪽 발에 상처가 있는 초코보에요! 전에 제가 구해줬거든요!","source_cn":"一只脚上有伤的陆行鸟！我之前救过它！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x747E2EB3E1D2CEF7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1130942002:1":{"text":"아주 온순하고 겁도 많아서 사람을 보면 바로 도망가요. 다른 초코보와 싸우지도 않고요.","source_cn":"它特别温顺，胆子也很小，看到人就立刻跑开，也不敢和其他...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2675903393775895","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1130942003:1":{"text":"근데 오늘 과일을 들고 와봤더니 다른 동물이랑 싸우고 있지 뭐예요!","source_cn":"可是今天，我拿着水果来看它的时候，它在和其他动物打成一团！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4C89313FAEE34103","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1130942004:1":{"text":"게다가 아주 무섭게 변해서… 마치 저를 알아보지 못하는 것처럼 입을 쩍 벌리고 저한테 덮치는 거예요!","source_cn":"而且，它变得好凶哦……好像不认识我了一样，张着嘴向我扑过来！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x44C2B4FE9B29B44B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1130942005:1":{"text":"너, 너무 무서워서 도망쳤는데… 다시 돌아와 보니 사라지고 없어요…","source_cn":"我、我太害怕，逃走了……再回来看时，库库亚也不见了……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x27B798F65E0E5B83","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:蛮血陶拉贡":{"text":"타우라곤","source":"蛮血陶拉贡","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":6,"localized_text_count":5,"speaker_count":1}}